{"page":20210,"part":1,"text":"钟鼎文\n\n\n钟鼎文\n\n三代已有文字而今不传，所传者惟《大禹岣嵝山碑》、《比干铜槃铭》、《周宣王石鼓文》、《穆王坛山刻石》、《孔子延陵十字碑》及《诅楚文》之类。前人有信之，有疑之，即如薛尚功《钟鼎款识》刻本，载有夏琱戈、钩带铭，及商器各种款识，余亦未敢信也，惟周钟、周鼎，及尊、彝、壶、爵、卣、鬲、斝、觶、觚、敦、簠、簋、盉、甗、匜、盘之文，尚有可据。虽后世亦有依式仿造者，而其铭文之古奥，字来之精严，决非后人所能伪作。故读书者，当先读六经，为文章之源流；讲篆隶者，当先考钟鼎文，为书法之源流也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20210,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"8eceb814c47369c331501d1e0a0fafaa4b37488cafaddae80b1c182703a31d7c","textSha256":"8eceb814c47369c331501d1e0a0fafaa4b37488cafaddae80b1c182703a31d7c","fileSha256":"8eceb814c47369c331501d1e0a0fafaa4b37488cafaddae80b1c182703a31d7c","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20210-work-149.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"书学 · 钟鼎文","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/u3X8UHVmvxDaReSv7bnrND","originalPages":[627,628],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":4,"sourceTextSha256":"f61bfa611e3251f4f97b636650af33411a67b7ec7750865e6e4f7b8b7601a6bf","id":"local-627-215-225","page_id":627,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":215,"rawEnd":225,"reviewedTextSha256":"7f46417ed7efd565614c49630fb8ea7d23a9efa021876bfc3b024c1c5d67a250","displayUnitOrigins":[[221,222],[222,223],[223,224],[224,225]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":627,"part":3,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"宋品宣","verifiedAt":"2026-10-20T07:23:22.316Z","revision":"7f46417ed7efd565614c49630fb8ea7d23a9efa021876bfc3b024c1c5d67a250","textSha256":"7f46417ed7efd565614c49630fb8ea7d23a9efa021876bfc3b024c1c5d67a250","fileSha256":"5e3a8e126438f8956a4f6192ae403b5c724c1b67665b9c18af94841661f1f0de","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-